    },
    {
     "term": "finite differences",
     "definition": "The one-time check, not the training method.",
     "anchor": "deep-ladder-1-from-graph-to-gradients-d11-d15-p01"
    },
    {
     "term": "forward-mode",
     "definition": "Compared against reverse-mode on 10M parameters, 1 output.",
